OL,3,GNEWSAApology as water supply disrupted
OL,4,Ain several towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn apology has been issued as residents
OL,7,Fin several towns continue to experience
OL,8,Fdisruption to their water supply.
OL,10,FSouth West Water said its engineers
OL,11,Fwere working to restore supply in
OL,12,FBuckfastleigh, Paignton, Kingsbridge
OL,13,Fand Totnes in Devon after issues were
OL,14,Freported due to air pockets in the
OL,15,Fnetwork.
OL,17,FA number of people said they had
OL,18,Fexperienced problems since Thursday
OL,19,Fevening, which had been resolved by
OL,20,FFriday night, before their water supply
OL,21,Fdropped out again on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
