OL,3,GNEWSAApology as water supply disrupted
OL,4,Ain several towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water said it was sorry for
OL,7,Fany inconvenience caused and added
OL,8,Fbottled water stations at Meadowbank
OL,9,FCar Park in Dartington and the Cattle
OL,10,FMarket car park in Kingsbridge would be
OL,11,Fopen until 22:00 BST.
